<title>USA: Moody's raises Maine Turnpike Authority to A2.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Maine Turnpike Authority to A2.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Feb 5 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating</p>
<p>Announcement As of 02/05/97</p>
<p>Issuer		: Maine Turnpike Auth. Turnpike rev.</p>
<p>State		 : ME</p>
<p>Rating		: A2</p>
<p>Sale Amount	 : 50,000,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 02/10/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
